[09:13.34]这还要看今后的工作。
[09:15.68]Today's announcement establishes the plan and the formal roles.
[09:15.68]今天的公告确定了计划和正式角色。
[09:20.36]Ava: Here's my recap.
[09:20.36]Ava：我来总结一下。
[09:21.59]Nebius already supports PyTorch training and fine-tuning on its cloud, provides compute for vLLM work, and contributes open-source optimizations.
[09:21.59]Nebius 已在其云平台支持 PyTorch 训练和微调，为 vLLM 相关工作提供算力，并贡献开源优化成果。
[09:32.78]Platinum membership adds a Governing Board seat, with Ryan Hanrui Wang also representing Nebius on the Technical Advisory Council.
[09:32.78]成为白金会员后，Nebius 将获得一个理事会席位，Ryan Hanrui Wang 也将代表 Nebius 加入技术咨询委员会。
[09:43.15]Brian: And the next areas to watch are PyTorch and vLLM performance on the latest hardware platforms, plus lessons from production-scale inference and post-training.
[09:43.15]Brian：接下来值得关注的是 PyTorch 和 vLLM 在最新硬件平台上的性能，以及生产规模推理和后训练的实践经验。
